---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Page not found — Lrnon"
  description="That page doesn't exist — but the lessons do. Head to the roadmap or your dashboard and keep learning.">
  <section class="container prose" style="padding-block:var(--sp-16);">
    <h1 style="font-size:var(--fs-500);">404 — not found</h1>
    <p>That page doesn't exist (or moved — our slugs are permanent, so more
    likely a typo). The learning is all still here:</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/roadmap">See the roadmap</a>
       <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/home" style="margin-inline-start:var(--sp-3);">Your dashboard</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
